  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TV Debate</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TV-debattprogram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen utg&#xF6;r ett st&#xF6;d till den centralamerikanska organisationen Fundesca f&#xF6;r att producera 50 timmars samh&#xE4;llsdebatterande TV-program f&#xF6;r en vuxen publik huvudsakligen i El Salvador. Programmen ska ha folkbildningskarakt&#xE4;r p&#xE5; tema bla om uppf&#xF6;ljning av fredsavtalen och konflikthantering och tas fram i samverkan med utvecklingsorganisationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution provides support to the Central American organization Fundesca to produce 50 hours of community debating television programs to an adult audience mainly in El Salvador. The programs shall have a general education character theme, among them the monitoring of the peace agreements and conflict resolution, and are developed in collaboration with development organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
